{"timestamp": 1779425487.8234231, "event_type": "meeting_called", "tick": 30, "data": {"caller": "player_5", "reason": "Frank called an emergency meeting", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Eve"}, {"room": "storage", "victim_name": "Charlie"}, {"room": "upper_engine", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779425487.824319, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 30, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779425487.8250544, "event_type": "free_roam_chat", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "name": "Frank", "room": "cafeteria", "message": "Only 3 of us left, we need to talk this out now before the Duck wins!", "tick": 30}}
{"timestamp": 1779425503.2391145, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I hit the emergency button because I realized we are down to just three people! Charlie, Diana, and Eve are all dead, which means we are at final three. If we don't vote out the Duck right now, we lose the game. \n\nI'm definitely innocent. My route this round was oxygen -> upper_engine -> lower_engine -> upper_engine -> medbay -> electrical -> cafeteria -> weapons, and then back to cafeteria where I hit the button. \n\nAlice, Bob, you were both in the cafeteria with me just before I called this meeting. Where have you two been all round? Did either of you see any bodies in security, storage, or upper engine? We need full routes from both of you right now. One of you is the Duck, so whoever's story has holes is getting my vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779425522.9672527, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Frank, you just caught yourself in a massive lie. \n\nFirst of all, you asked if we saw bodies in Security, Storage, or Upper Engine. Your claimed route never even goes near Security or Storage. How would you know to ask about bodies in those specific rooms unless you were the one who left them there?\n\nSecond, your route on the left side of the map is completely fake. My route was Weapons -> Security -> Navigation -> Storage -> Lower Engine -> Upper Engine -> Oxygen -> Cafeteria. I was in Lower Engine and Upper Engine during the mid-to-late round. I saw Diana alive in Lower Engine at tick 21. I then moved up to Upper Engine and Oxygen, where I saw Bob enter Oxygen from Upper Engine at tick 26. I never saw you anywhere on the left side of the ship, Frank.\n\nBob, I can vouch for you being in Oxygen and coming to Cafeteria with me at the end of the round. Frank is the Duck trying to pull a fast one with this emergency meeting. We need to vote Frank right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779425541.9838674, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Yeah I\u2019m with Alice here. Frank\u2019s story doesn\u2019t line up.\n\nMy route was electrical/medbay back and forth early, then cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria. I saw Eve and Charlie on the right side early, then Charlie/Diana around storage/lower/upper later. I also saw Diana move from lower engine to upper engine, and then I went into oxygen and ended up back cafeteria with Alice.\n\nThe key thing: I never saw Frank on the left side at all, and Alice is right \u2014 him randomly naming Security, Storage, and Upper Engine as possible body spots is super weird when he claims he didn\u2019t go Security or Storage. That sounds like he knows where bodies are.\n\nAlice and I basically converged from oxygen into cafeteria at the end. Frank came in and slammed button at final three with a prebuilt accusation. I think this is Frank trying to get one of us misvoted. Vote Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779425557.3008583, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Alice"}}
{"timestamp": 1779425577.822477, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Frank"}}
{"timestamp": 1779425587.5027874, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019m locking Frank. Alice\u2019s route matches what I saw at the end \u2014 she came out of oxygen into cafeteria, and I came in from that same side. Frank\u2019s route doesn\u2019t explain why he\u2019s calling out Security/Storage/Upper Engine body spots, and I never saw him on the left side when he claims he was there.\n\nIf Alice were Duck, she had a chance to push suspicion way earlier or kill around oxygen/cafeteria, but instead Frank hits button and immediately frames both of us. This feels like a final-three setup.\n\nVote Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779425587.5037146, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 30, "data": {"phase": "voting"}}
